<title>USA: CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 6.</title>
<headline>CBOT soyoil deliveries - Sept 6.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against the September soyoil for September 9 (In contracts).</p>
<p>SOYOIL - 2,390 lots. Oldest long - September 5, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - 1st option/c 100, produce grain/h 467, central/h 2, combs/h 1, dorman/c 75, combs/c 50, ing/c 122, 1st option/c 262, kenosha/h 465, tenco/c 1, 1st option/c 250, 1st option/h 483, ADM Investor Services/h 112.</p>
<p>Received - 1st option/c 126, combs/h 26, dorman/c 111, combs/c 62, ING/c 218, refco/c 18, 1st option/c 424, kenosha/h 435, 1st option/c 219, 1st option/c 651.</p>
<p>H=house account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
